    {
      "en": "label yumidorm30:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I knock on Yumi’s door and wait for-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Go the fuck away! I’m busy.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I knock on Yumi’s door and she immediately answers.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Busy doing what?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are all of your clothes on?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of fucking course they are! But that shouldn't make a-",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cool. Then that means I can come in.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the fuck do you think you’re doing?! I just said no!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I open Yumi’s door and make my way into the room, which she definitely wanted me to do.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook1.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Get out!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you...studying?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I knew it was something this boring, I really would have left you alone.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cool! Bye!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So what are you studying?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook2.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A bunch of different shit Chika told me about since she knows I’m trying to get a job.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, what happened to this being too boring to stick around for?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know where the door is, right? Sure had no trouble finding it on the way in.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If it’s something unrelated to actual education, I’m totally fine with helping you study.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What did Chika tell you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook3.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should probably at least try to sound like a good teacher every once in a while.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Saying you’ll help me study with everything except[school] is like...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t even know what it’s like. But it’s stupid.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now fuck off.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I see the notebook?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook1.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No! You can’t see the fucking notebook!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why not? You’re not secretly writing me another love note, are you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook4.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Love note?! I never wrote you a fucking love note!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All I said was that you aren’t the worst thing ever!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which was a total lie by the way, as I’m pretty sure you can tell right now!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know if you keep yelling, someone is going to find out I’m in here, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook5.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shouldn’t you be more worried about that than me? The fuck do I have to lose if someone finds out about this?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chances are they probably heard me screaming at you to not come in anyway.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I sit down?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook6.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure, Sensei. I’d love that. In fact, why don’t you walk outside and take a seat on the curb? I’ll be down to meet you in just a few moments.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I meant on the bed.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook7.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The second you sit on my bed is the second I decide to throw myself into a volcano.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bad idea. I can’t imagine there are many job openings inside of volcanoes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook8.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you get out of my room now? Your jokes fucking blow and you’re distracting me from doing something that you suggested I do in the first place.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let me help, for real this time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What sort of stuff did Chika tell you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A bunch of shit that you never did. Like how important it is to smile and what an iDeCo is.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don’t think you need to be worrying about iDeCo’s for a part time job.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe I don’t. But who do you think I should believe: some deadbeat who spends his entire work day staring at boobs or some girl who’s working her ass off to support her sister?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Damnit, Chika. Why do you have to be so good?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You’re making me look bad.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I mean, technically I’m making me look bad.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But you’re not helping at all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, fine. Whatever. I’m sure that even bringing up some term like “iDeCo” will make you look good in an interview, so we won’t cross it off for now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m more worried about the fuckin’ smiling part. I have no idea how to do that.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You just smiled at me like a minute ago when you told me to go sit on the curb.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook9.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I did?!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. I remember distinctly because it hurt me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe that’s the trick then? Maybe I just need to think of you every time I want to smile?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know that you meant that in an insulting way, but it sounded very cute and I am no longer hurt.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook10.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ew! Gross! Please don’t even joke about that meaning what...you thought it sounded like. Or something.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fuck you.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That aside, what else do you have in there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did Chika give you any ideas on more places to apply?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook11.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...she suggested a few places from the mall. But I’ve been caught stealing there before and I don’t know if I’m allowed back.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t imagine they keep track of everyone who’s stolen from them before. That sounds like way too much work.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably not, but like three of the places she said I should apply to have caught me. And I don’t want word gettin’ around and shit.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just how many times have you stolen things from the mall?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook12.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...I don’t know. A lot?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m a fucking [teenage]girl. Even if I wasn’t a delinquent, I’d be stealing shit from the mall. Literally everyone does it.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well then there you go. It’s not a big deal after all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook13.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh shit. Maybe you’re right?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And like, there are a lot of fucking stores at the mall. There has to be at least one there that would take me. Right?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve just gotta walk in, smile, namedrop the iDeCo and I’m in.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m still not sold on the iDeCo thing, but yeah. We can try that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We? You’re coming with me again?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course. I basically consider myself your manager at this point.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shitty fucking manager. All you do is stalk me and look at me like I’m some sort of meal or something.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t imagine you would taste good. You are pretty fucking malnourished, Yumi.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook1.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, well you’re mal-whatever too, asshole! You would probably taste like fucking...stale bread and foot fungus!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have such a way with words. I suggest repeating that same phrase during your next interview.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook14.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...are we done here?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just asking me the shit I wrote down already isn’t exactly helpful.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And now that we figured out that thing about the mall, I think it’s safe to say you’re going to be useless for the rest of the night.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": New idea- how about we stop doing job stuff all together and talk about something else?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The last time we did that, you sat there and watched me eat ice cream for ten minutes.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can’t say I’m excited to live through that level of trauma again.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thankfully, there’s no ice cream around.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But if you wanted to maybe close your eyes and drink from one of those water bottles-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook1.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Stop with this weird fucking fetish of watching me eat and drink stuff! It doesn’t make any sense!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then stop trying to push me away and actually talk to me for a little while.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you’re not going to be serious, neither am I.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But if you can hold a conversation without jumping down my throat, maybe we can actually get somewhere?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumidormnotebook15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumidormnotebook15.webp",
      "alt": "yumidormnotebook15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want to believe you, but you kind of just fucking waltzed in here even though I told you not to.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why the fuck should I humor you if you won’t even be chill enough to respect a wish as simple as “don’t open the door.”",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because, at this rate, you will literally never open the door for me. Or anyone, really.",
